# The Start Menu of a real guest, as get-appmenus.ps1's sweep found it.
#
# MEASURED 2026-10-07 on a clone of the win11de-qwt golden - German Windows 11 25H2
# (26200.8037), QWT-NG installed, no third-party software. One path per line, relative to
# "%ProgramData%\Microsoft\Windows\Start Menu\Programs", exactly as the sweep sees them.
#
# Note what the German guest proves: the DIRECTORY names are English. Windows localizes only
# the displayed folder name, through desktop.ini - so matching a folder name literally is
# correct across locales.
